Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13. Recommended next step", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f156c691-2ad2-2947-b73d-27b93e39e70c"],

Cell["\<\
The next mathematically cleaner extension would be to replace the flat-torus \
proxy operator by a true torus Laplace--Beltrami operator built from the \
induced metric. That would allow:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"76c13871-ae74-0541-bfcc-b800fe69f6cd"],

Cell["1. linearization directly on the embedded torus geometry,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3f5b4c43-082c-6640-80a0-1ead2ef400cb"],

Cell["2. geometry-dependent eigenspectrum shifts,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2f5db1c9-41fb-cf4c-bf58-68dc52348b1a"],

Cell["\<\
3. and comparison between flat-proxy and embedded-torus stability results.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dd1b424b-85a3-c844-8210-64a976a7d7de"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
